In this pi setup, builtin subagents (worker/scout/planner) have `inheritSkills: false` by default, so delegated tasks must include the relevant skill contract, artifact paths, acceptance criteria, and validation commands explicitly. In pi-subagents, AGENTS.md delegation rules are advisory: the extension exposes a callable subagent tool but does not automatically delegate or police primary repository tools. Reliable mandatory delegation requires a primary-side runtime guard (e.g., a global extension intercepting tool_call). <!-- created=2026-08-06, last=2026-08-07 -->
